                                                                                
*--------------------------------------------------------------------*          
*--------PROGRAM SKRIVET AV PER VIKMAN SOM NU HÖRS I PRODUKTION -----*          
*--------FÖR ATT KUNNA DISTRIBUERA UT LISTORNA ----------------------*          
*--------------------------------------------------------------------*          
*--------PROGRAMMET OMSKRIVET AV MÅNS SAMUELSSON 941126--------------*          
*--------------------------------------------------------------------*          
*--------------------------------------------------------------------*          
*--------------------------------------------------------------------*          
*--------------------------------------------------------------------*          
FILE W61173D1                                                                   
%W91042                                                                         
*                                                                               
FILE VLB-FIL FB(37 0)VIRTUAL RETAIN                                             
     V-ARTNR    1  5 P                                                          
     V-BEFT     *  2 P                                                          
     V-EMBQ0    *  5 P                                                          
     V-EMBQ1    *  5 P                                                          
     V-EMBQ2    *  5 P                                                          
     V-KDFORP   *  3 P                                                          
     V-KVANT    *  3 P                                                          
     V-KDPRODSL *  2 P                                                          
     V-IDLEVNR  *  5 A                                                          
     V-ADLAGOMR *  2 P                                                          
*                                                                               
FILE VLBFIL2 FB(41 0) VIRTUAL RETAIN                                            
     V2-ARTNR    1  5 P                                                         
     V2-BEFT     *  2 P                                                         
     V2-EMBQ0    *  5 P                                                         
     V2-EMBQ1    *  5 P                                                         
     V2-EMBQ2    *  5 P                                                         
     V2-KDFORP   *  3 P                                                         
     V2-KVANT    *  3 P                                                         
     V2-KDPRODSL *  2 P                                                         
     V2-IDLEVNR  *  5 A                                                         
     V2-ADLAGOMR *  2 P                                                         
     V2-FBGRP    *  4 A                                                         
*                                                                               
FILE W61173D2 FB(28 0)                                                          
     I-ARTNR    1  5 P                                                          
     I-BEFT     *  2 P                                                          
     I-EMBQ0    *  5 P                                                          
     I-EMBQ1    *  5 P                                                          
     I-EMBQ2    *  5 P                                                          
     I-KDFORP   *  3 P                                                          
     I-KVANT    *  3 P                                                          
*                                                                               
FILE OLD-FIL FB(28 0)VIRTUAL                                                    
     O-PARTNO   1  5 P                                                          
     O-BEFT     *  2 P                                                          
     O-EMBQ0    *  5 P                                                          
     O-EMBQ1    *  5 P                                                          
     O-EMBQ2    *  5 P                                                          
     O-KDFORP   *  3 P                                                          
     O-KVANT    *  3 P                                                          
*                                                                               
FILE NEWFIL FB(41 0) VIRTUAL RETAIN                                             
     N-PARTNO   1  5 P                                                          
     N-BEFT     *  2 P                                                          
     N-EMBQ0    *  5 P                                                          
     N-EMBQ1    *  5 P                                                          
     N-EMBQ2    *  5 P                                                          
     N-KDFORP   *  3 P                                                          
     N-KVANT    *  3 P                                                          
     N-KDPRODSL *  2 P                                                          
     N-IDLEVNR  *  5 A                                                          
     N-ADLAGOMR *  2 P                                                          
     N-FBGRP    *  4 A                                                          
*                                                                               
FILE W61173D3 FB(28 0)                                                          
     U-ARTNR    1  5 P                                                          
     U-BEFT     *  2 P                                                          
     U-EMBQ0    *  5 P                                                          
     U-EMBQ1    *  5 P                                                          
     U-EMBQ2    *  5 P                                                          
     U-KDFORP   *  3 P                                                          
     U-KVANT    *  3 P                                                          
*                                                                               
FILE W61173D4 PRINTER                                                           
*                                                                               
FILE W61173D5 PRINTER                                                           
*                                                                               
FILE W61173D6 PRINTER                                                           
*                                                                               
FILE W61173D7 PRINTER                                                           
*                                                                               
FILE W61173D8                                                                   
FB-IDLEVNR 1 5 A                                                                
FB-ADINLOMR 6 4 A                                                               
*                                                                               
*-------------------------------------------------*                             
*VARIABLER                                                                      
 PARTNO      W  5 P                                                             
 W-ADLAGOMR  W  2 N   HEADING 'SA'                                              
 FBGRP       W  4 A   HEADING 'FB'                                              
 NEW-Q0EMB   W  5 P                                                             
 NEW-Q1EMB   W  5 P                                                             
 NEW-Q2EMB   W  5 P                                                             
 NEW-KVANT   W  3 P                                                             
 NEW-PTYPE   W  2 P   HEADING ('NEW' 'PTYPE')                                   
 NEW-PCODE   W  3 P   HEADING ('NEW' 'PCODE')                                   
 OLD-Q0EMB   W  5 P                                                             
 OLD-Q1EMB   W  5 P                                                             
 OLD-Q2EMB   W  5 P                                                             
 OLD-KVANT   W  3 P                                                             
 OLD-PTYPE   W  2 P   HEADING ('OLD' 'PTYPE')                                   
 OLD-PCODE   W  3 P   HEADING ('OLD' 'PCODE')                                   
 W-KDFORP    W  4 N                                                             
 W-KDFORP-1 W-KDFORP 1 N                                                        
 W-KDFORP-2 W-KDFORP +1 2 N                                                     
 W-KDFORP-4 W-KDFORP +3 1 N                                                     
                                                                                
 WS-KDPRODSL W  2 P                                                             
%WWPRODSL  'WS-' WORK ''                                                        
*    -- CHECKED BY WY2000                                                       
*-------------------------------------------------*                             
* AKTIVITET 1                                     *                             
*-------------------------------------------------*                             
JOB INPUT W61173D1                                                              
  WS-KDPRODSL = KDPRODSL                                                        
  PERFORM S25-CHECK-WS-KDPRODSL                                                 
  IF BEFT = 10 THRU 44 59 THRU 89  AND +                                        
     KDERS < 20                    AND +                                        
     KDPRODSL = KDPRODSL-VOLVO-BIMA                                             
     V-ARTNR = IDARTNR                                                          
     V-IDLEVNR = IDLEVNR                                                        
     V-BEFT = BEFT                                                              
     V-EMBQ0 = IDARTNR-EMBQ0                                                    
     V-EMBQ1 = IDARTNR-EMBQ1                                                    
     V-EMBQ2 = IDARTNR-EMBQ2                                                    
     W-KDFORP-1 = KDFORPPL                                                      
     W-KDFORP-2 = KDFORPGP                                                      
     W-KDFORP-4 = KDFORPUF                                                      
     V-KDFORP = W-KDFORP                                                        
     V-KVANT = KVQPACK-1                                                        
     V-KDPRODSL = KDPRODSL                                                      
     V-IDLEVNR  = IDLEVNR                                                       
     V-ADLAGOMR = ADLAGOMR                                                      
     PUT VLB-FIL                                                                
     U-ARTNR = IDARTNR                                                          
     U-BEFT = BEFT                                                              
     U-EMBQ0 = IDARTNR-EMBQ0                                                    
     U-EMBQ1 = IDARTNR-EMBQ1                                                    
     U-EMBQ2 = IDARTNR-EMBQ2                                                    
     U-KDFORP = W-KDFORP                                                        
     U-KVANT = KVQPACK-1                                                        
     PUT W61173D3                                                               
  END-IF                                                                        
%WWPRODSL 'WS-' PROC ''                                                         
*-------------------------------------------------*                             
* KOMPLETTERA VLB-FIL MED FB-GRUPP                *                             
*-------------------------------------------------*                             
SORT VLB-FIL TO VLB-FIL USING V-IDLEVNR                                         
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (W61173D8 KEY (FB-IDLEVNR) +                                          
          (VLB-FIL  KEY (V-IDLEVNR)))                                           
   IF MATCHED                                                                   
     V2-ARTNR    = V-ARTNR                                                      
     V2-BEFT     = V-BEFT                                                       
     V2-EMBQ0    = V-EMBQ0                                                      
     V2-EMBQ1    = V-EMBQ1                                                      
     V2-EMBQ2    = V-EMBQ2                                                      
     V2-KDFORP   = V-KDFORP                                                     
     V2-KVANT    = V-KVANT                                                      
     V2-KDPRODSL = V-KDPRODSL                                                   
     V2-IDLEVNR  = V-IDLEVNR                                                    
     V2-ADLAGOMR = V-ADLAGOMR                                                   
     V2-FBGRP    = FB-ADINLOMR                                                  
     PUT VLBFIL2                                                                
   ELSE                                                                         
     IF VLB-FIL                                                                 
       V2-ARTNR    = V-ARTNR                                                    
       V2-BEFT     = V-BEFT                                                     
       V2-EMBQ0    = V-EMBQ0                                                    
       V2-EMBQ1    = V-EMBQ1                                                    
       V2-EMBQ2    = V-EMBQ2                                                    
       V2-KDFORP   = V-KDFORP                                                   
       V2-KVANT    = V-KVANT                                                    
       V2-KDPRODSL = V-KDPRODSL                                                 
       V2-IDLEVNR  = V-IDLEVNR                                                  
       V2-ADLAGOMR = V-ADLAGOMR                                                 
       V2-FBGRP    = '    '                                                     
       PUT VLBFIL2                                                              
     END-IF                                                                     
   END-IF                                                                       
*                                                                               
SORT VLBFIL2 TO VLBFIL2 USING V2-ARTNR                                          
*                                                                               
*-------------------------------------------------*                             
* MATCH VLBFIL2/W61173D2                         *                              
*-------------------------------------------------*                             
JOB INPUT +                                                                     
(VLBFIL2 KEY(V2-ARTNR V2-BEFT V2-EMBQ0 V2-EMBQ1 +                               
              V2-EMBQ2 V2-KDFORP V2-KVANT) +                                    
 W61173D2 KEY(I-ARTNR I-BEFT I-EMBQ0 I-EMBQ1 I-EMBQ2 I-KDFORP I-KVANT))         
  IF NOT MATCHED                                                                
    IF VLBFIL2                                                                  
       PUT NEWFIL FROM VLBFIL2                                                  
    END-IF                                                                      
    IF W61173D2                                                                 
       PUT OLD-FIL FROM W61173D2                                                
    END-IF                                                                      
  END-IF                                                                        
*-------------------------------------------------*                             
* MATCH NEWFIL/OLD-FIL                           *                              
*-------------------------------------------------*                             
JOB INPUT (NEWFIL  KEY(N-PARTNO) +                                              
           OLD-FIL  KEY(O-PARTNO))                                              
  IF MATCHED                                                                    
     PARTNO    = N-PARTNO                                                       
     W-ADLAGOMR  = N-ADLAGOMR                                                   
     FBGRP     = N-FBGRP                                                        
     NEW-PTYPE = N-BEFT                                                         
     NEW-Q0EMB = N-EMBQ0                                                        
     NEW-Q1EMB = N-EMBQ1                                                        
     NEW-Q2EMB = N-EMBQ2                                                        
     NEW-PCODE = N-KDFORP                                                       
     NEW-KVANT = N-KVANT                                                        
     OLD-PTYPE = O-BEFT                                                         
     OLD-Q0EMB = O-EMBQ0                                                        
     OLD-Q1EMB = O-EMBQ1                                                        
     OLD-Q2EMB = O-EMBQ2                                                        
     OLD-PCODE = O-KDFORP                                                       
     OLD-KVANT = O-KVANT                                                        
     PRINT RPT01                                                                
     PRINT RPT02                                                                
     WS-KDPRODSL = N-KDPRODSL                                                   
     PERFORM S25-CHECK-WS-KDPRODSL                                              
     IF N-KDPRODSL = KDPRODSL-VCBV                                              
       PRINT RPT03                                                              
     END-IF                                                                     
     PRINT RPT04                                                                
  END-IF                                                                        
%WWPRODSL 'WS-' PROC ''                                                         
*-------------------------------------------------*                             
REPORT      RPT01         +                                                     
            LINESIZE 120  +                                                     
            SPACE 1  PRINTER W61173D4                                           
*                                                                               
SEQUENCE    PARTNO                                                              
*                                                                               
TITLE 01    '************'                                                      
TITLE 02    'CHANGES IN EMB Q0,Q1,Q2,KVANT,P-TYPE,P-CODE SINCE LAST RUN'        
*                                                                               
LINE        PARTNO      +                                                       
            NEW-Q0EMB   +                                                       
            NEW-Q1EMB   +                                                       
            NEW-Q2EMB   +                                                       
            NEW-KVANT   +                                                       
            NEW-PTYPE   +                                                       
            NEW-PCODE   +                                                       
            OLD-Q0EMB   +                                                       
            OLD-Q1EMB   +                                                       
            OLD-Q2EMB   +                                                       
            OLD-KVANT   +                                                       
            OLD-PTYPE   +                                                       
            OLD-PCODE                                                           
*-------------------------------------------------*                             
REPORT      RPT02         +                                                     
            LINESIZE 120  +                                                     
            SPACE 1  PRINTER W61173D5                                           
*                                                                               
SEQUENCE    W-ADLAGOMR                                                          
*                                                                               
CONTROL     FINAL NOPRINT W-ADLAGOMR NOPRINT NEWPAGE                            
